IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COPYDEMO.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY custrec.
01 WS-FEE PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    COMPUTE WS-FEE = WS-CUST-BAL * 0.02 ROUNDED.
    DISPLAY "Customer: " WS-CUST-NAME.
    DISPLAY "Balance:  " WS-CUST-BAL.
    DISPLAY "Fee (2%): " WS-FEE.
    STOP RUN.
